WEBVTT

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.220
<v><b>I:</b></v> Do you have more free time than three years ago?

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:17.420
<v><b>K:</b></v> I actually definitely do have more free time than I did a couple of years ago,

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.795
as I actually just graduated from college.

00:00:19.905 --> 00:00:24.926
This is my first year working full time, so working nine to five frees up your evenings,

00:00:24.926 --> 00:00:27.380
so definitely more free time than before.

00:00:33.078 --> 00:00:35.700
<v><b>I:</b></v> What’s the most beautiful city you’ve ever been to?

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:37.800
<v><b>S:</b></v> That’s such a good question.

00:00:37.852 --> 00:00:40.140
Um, I think probably Athens.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.180
<v><b>I:</b></v> Why?

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:44.734
<v><b>S:</b></v> It’s, it’s just, it’s absolutely gorgeous there – the Acropolis,

00:00:44.734 --> 00:00:47.260
the Parthenon, the sights are beautiful.

00:00:48.745 --> 00:00:50.460
Yeah, it’s the best place to go.

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:03.180
<v><b>I:</b></v> What do you drink in a typical day?

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:07.635
<v><b>A:</b></v> In a typical day I usually just drink,

00:01:08.147 --> 00:01:12.860
er, a lot of coffee and water, sometimes juice.

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:16.200
<v><b>I:</b></v> Is there anything you drink too much of?

00:01:16.902 --> 00:01:18.726
<v><b>A:</b></v> I probably drink too much coffee.

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.840
<v><b>I:</b></v> Is there anything you don’t drink enough of?

00:01:22.241 --> 00:01:24.600
<v><b>A:</b></v> I don’t drink enough water most days,

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:25.817
but I’m trying to get better.

00:01:30.739 --> 00:01:33.097
<v><b>I:</b></v> Are you an optimist or a pessimist?

00:01:33.414 --> 00:01:34.940
<v><b>C:</b></v> I am a realist.

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:39.380
Um, yeah, more pessimistic than optimistic.

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:49.180
<v><b>I:</b></v> Do you often dream about the same thing?

00:01:49.668 --> 00:01:50.799
<v><b>P:</b></v> Yes, I do.

00:01:51.481 --> 00:01:56.060
I had a really, really awful teacher at high school for history,

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.260
and she was always really mean.

00:01:59.188 --> 00:02:04.739
And when I finished high school, I always dreamed that she would say,

00:02:04.923 --> 00:02:06.940
‘You will never pass your A levels’.

00:02:07.118 --> 00:02:11.323
And now I always dream of the same teacher from high school telling me,

00:02:11.323 --> 00:02:12.889
‘You will never finish your degree,’

00:02:12.892 --> 00:02:16.100
so that’s kind of weird, yeah.